<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 20.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - Feb 20.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement in trading upto noon (0630 GMT) on Thursday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during this period, their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at (0630 GMT) was 3515.81,12.63 points or 0.36 percent lower than Wednesday's close.</p>
